<title>GREECE: ATHLETICS-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIPS TIMETABLE - AUGUST 10.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIPS TIMETABLE - AUGUST 10.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-08-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Timetable for the final day of</p>
<p>competition at the world athletics championships on</p>
<p>Sunday (all times GMT):</p>
<p>0505 - Men's marathon (start)</p>
<p>0715 - Men's marathon (finish)</p>
<p>1430 - Men's pole vault final</p>
<p>1500 - Women's high jump final</p>
<p>1500 - Men's discus final</p>
<p>1600 - Women's 100 metres hurdles semifinals</p>
<p>1625 - Men's 5,000 metres final</p>
<p>1655 - Men's 4x100 metres relay final</p>
<p>1715 - Women's 4x400 metres relay final</p>
<p>1735 - Women's 100 metres hurdles final</p>
<p>1750 - Men's 4x400 metres relay final</p>
</text>
